% Scenario: the pen is round in the user space of the stroke. Under a
% scale of 3 by 1 a line 10 wide is 30 wide on the page where it runs
% up and 10 wide where it runs across (PLRM3 §8.2 setlinewidth); the
% outline (page 1) has the same shape as the stroke (page 2).
/path { 40 150 moveto 40 450 lineto 160 450 lineto } def
3 1 scale 10 setlinewidth
path strokepath fill
showpage
3 1 scale 10 setlinewidth
path stroke
showpage
